10.2 Defect Severity

Severity

Definition

Release Rule

Critical

Data loss, unauthorized access, broken core journey, rights violation, or unusable export.

Must be fixed before acceptance.

High

Major feature failure without reliable workaround.

Fix before final demonstration unless formally accepted.

Medium

Partial failure with a usable workaround.

Fix if capacity allows or document clearly.

Low

Cosmetic or minor usability issue.

May be deferred with issue reference.

10.3 Bug Workflow

New → Triaged → Assigned → In Progress → Ready for QA → Verified → Closed

If QA cannot reproduce or the fix fails, return the issue to the responsible developer with evidence.

